OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticises decision to
OL,4,Ascrap 20mph zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and councillors have
OL,7,Fcriticised a decision to remove several
OL,8,Froads from proposed 20mph zones in a
OL,9,FLeicestershire town.
OL,11,FThe county council is consulting on
OL,12,Fplans to introduce 20mph limits on a
OL,13,Fnumber of streets, including Market
OL,14,FStreet, South Street and Kilwardby
OL,15,FStreet in Ashby-de-la-Zouch.
OL,17,FBut roads previously identified for
OL,18,Finclusion, such as Wood Street,
OL,19,FNottingham Road and Derby Road, have
OL,20,Fsince been dropped from the proposals.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
