OL,3,GNEWSACouncil criticises decision to
OL,4,Ascrap 20mph zones
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Stanley from Ashby Town Council
OL,7,Fsaid the changes had caused concern and
OL,8,Fconfusion among residents and called on
OL,9,Fhighways officials to reinstate the
OL,10,Foriginal plans.
